t_comment_author": "beggarwaste", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVCsubDS.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/RaGhkNZWlhHv.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/sxjKJbm7iWHQp1AU.jpeg", "width": 583, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 680}], "blurhash": "UNHeUj-;%hRj^*%MxuV@$ixuxuae~qkCRPjZ", "full_resolution": [680, 583]}, "title": "Lab Created Eggs & Egg Whites NOW in Walmart & Target. This Will Accelerate Human Disease & Suffering. Genetically Engineered yeast programmed with a chicken GENE SEQUENCE (aka mRNA) to make SYNTHETIC Plastic Protein in giant tanks. FDA Approved \u2014 Already in baked goods, protein bars, pasta, sauces.", "last_comment_created": 1789086736044, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 14, "score_up": 83, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVCsvySX", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 37, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8828581, "raw_content": "Mid-term polling is looking dismal.  My personal opinion is he forgot why we elected him.  We should have several massive legislative victories by now, but all I see is dog shit.  Yes, I understand executive orders have limits.  Yes, I understand (D) activists judges are stalling every lawsuit as long as possible.  Yes, I understand real change comes from legislation (that Congress is sitting on.)\n\nSo flip the script back in their faces.\n\nPublish a plan for the mid-term wins.  Just like Gingrich did.  What legislation will be pushed though in the first 100 days.  ***Then emphasize the importance of achieving the largest majorities in the House & Senate as possible.*** \n\nFor example:\n\n55% + in the House and Senate give us:\n- Election Integrity [SAVE] Act (single-day in-person voting, paper ballots, hand counting, no machines)\n- Immigration Act (repealing the '65 Immigration Act in its entirety, and repealing the '90 Temporary Protected Status nonsense)\n- Visa Act (all visa programs cancelled, all marital visas automatically revoked upon divorce, no economic visas unless US unemployment is under 3% annually for the last 5 consecutive years, automatic deportation upon discovery regardless of location, etc.) \n- Military Pay Raises Act. \n- No Tax on Social Security Act. \n- Repeal Osamacare Act \n- Health Insurance Companies Must Be Non-profit and Permitted To Operate Beyond State Boundries Act.\n\n67%+ in the House and Senate:  (the magical 2/3's majority)\n- Term Limits amendment\n- Balanced Budget amendment\n- Election Integrity amendment\n- Judical Review & Removal amendment\n- - - - -\n***(p.s. publicly denounce John Thune, and get someone as Senate Leader that isn't a RINO for a change.)***", "author": "greatpumpkin", "created": 1789087122848, "profile_picture": "THJfFaQLwuCH", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "President Trump, if you want to win the mid-terms, you need to channel the ghost of Newt Gingrich's \"Contract With America\"; get it in front of the public day & night.", "last_comment_created": 1789087122847, "content": "<p>Mid-term polling is looking dismal.  My personal opinion is he forgot why we elected him.  We should have several massive legislative victories by now, but all I see is dog shit.  Yes, I understand executive orders have limits.  Yes, I understand (D) activists judges are stalling every lawsuit as long as possible.  Yes, I understand real change comes from legislation (that Congress is sitting on.)</p>\n<p>So flip the script back in their faces.</p>\n<p>Publish a plan for the mid-term wins.  Just like Gingrich did.  What legislation will be pushed though in the first 100 days.  <em><strong>Then emphasize the importance of achieving the largest majorities in the House &amp; Senate as possible.</strong></em></p>\n<p>For example:</p>\n<p>55% + in the House and Senate give us:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Election Integrity [SAVE] Act (single-day in-person voting, paper ballots, hand counting, no machines)</li>\n<li>Immigration Act (repealing the '65 Immigration Act in its entirety, and repealing the '90 Temporary Protected Status nonsense)</li>\n<li>Visa Act (all visa programs cancelled, all marital visas automatically revoked upon divorce, no economic visas unless US unemployment is under 3% annually for the last 5 consecutive years, automatic deportation upon discovery regardless of location, etc.)</li>\n<li>Military Pay Raises Act.</li>\n<li>No Tax on Social Security Act.</li>\n<li>Repeal Osamacare Act</li>\n<li>Health Insurance Companies Must Be Non-profit and Permitted To Operate Beyond State Boundries Act.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>67%+ in the House and Senate:  (the magical 2/3's majority)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Term Limits amendment</li>\n<li>Balanced Budget amendment</li>\n<li>Election Integrity amendment</li>\n<li>Judical Review &amp; Removal amendment</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><em><strong>(p.s. publicly denounce John Thune, and get someone as Senate Leader that isn't a RINO for a change.)</strong></em></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 37, "is_edited": false, "is_moderat